+# 2026-11-01
+
+- Added admin-only `GET /api/admin/users/recently-created` (logins of users created in the last 7 days).
+- `UserRepository.findAllByCreatedDateAfter(Instant)` holds the query; `UserService.getRecentlyCreatedUserLogins()` computes the boundary with the injected `Clock`.
+- No `Clock` bean existed, so `config/ClockConfiguration` now provides `Clock.systemUTC()`; `UserService` takes it as a constructor argument.
+- Build and tests were not run (requested).
+- Next: add tests for the endpoint (integration test in `UserResourceIT`, service test with a fixed clock).
